OL,3,A'My mortgage is going up #200 a month':
OL,4,AHow rising interest rates are hitting
OL,5,Apeople's pockets
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday, the Bank of England
OL,8,Fincreased interest rates for the first
OL,9,Ftime in over three years as it tries to
OL,10,Fget a grip on rising inflation linked
OL,11,Fto the Iran war.
OL,13,FExperts say there could be more hikes
OL,14,Fover the next 18 months, as the
OL,15,Fconflict continues to push up food,
OL,16,Ffuel and energy prices across the UK
OL,17,Fand worldwide.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,114,105,200,300,0,100
