OL,3,A'My mortgage is going up #200 a month':
OL,4,AHow rising interest rates are hitting
OL,5,Apeople's pockets
OL,6,
OL,7,FHigher interest rates affect borrowing
OL,8,Fcosts, however, which means mortgages,
OL,9,Fcredit cards and personal loans could
OL,10,Fget more expensive for millions, even
OL,11,Fas savings rates improve.
OL,13,FFor some, it could mean extra financial
OL,14,Fpressure at a time when they are
OL,15,Falready struggling with the cost of
OL,16,Fliving. The BBC spoke to three people
OL,17,Fabout how they could be affected.
